      <title>闰秒结束使命 一个让全球计算机头疼半个世纪的“一秒钟”即将退场</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260907/%E9%97%B0%E7%A7%92%E7%BB%93%E6%9D%9F%E4%BD%BF%E5%91%BD-%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%AE%A9%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%A4%B4%E7%96%BC%E5%8D%8A%E4%B8%AA%E4%B8%96%E7%BA%AA%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%92%E9%92%9F%E5%8D%B3%E5%B0%86%E9%80%80%E5%9C%BA/</link>
